# Testing

## Layout

- Mirror source paths under `tests/` (e.g. `tests/lib/org-permissions.test.ts` for `src/lib/org-permissions.ts`)
- Security tests live in `tests/security/` — IDOR, tenant isolation, rate limiting, auth guard

## Unit tests

- Framework: Vitest + Testing Library
- Run: `pnpm test` (watch) or `pnpm test:ci` (CI single run)
- Name tests after user outcomes, not function signatures

## E2E & accessibility

- E2E: Playwright — `pnpm test:e2e`
- A11y: axe via Playwright — `pnpm test:a11y`
- Storybook addon-a11y for component-level checks (see `accessibility-wcag.mdc`)

## CI gates

| Gate | Command | Includes |
|------|---------|----------|
| PR / local check | `make check` | lint, format, typecheck, security-audit, i18n, vitest, storybook-build, a11y |
| Pre-push / CI | `make pre-push` | `make check` + E2E (`pnpm test:e2e`) |

- `make ci` is identical to `make pre-push`
- Never use `--no-verify` unless explicitly requested (see `git-hooks.mdc`)
